@flexiarg ways-of-working/one-queryable-self-account
@title Everything that exists is on the map, or it is a hole
@keywords way of working, invariant, cascade live
@audience agents, operators, institution designers
@tone normative
@style pattern
@status draft 2026-11-02 by claude-16; runs correct it
@provenance declared in futon3c/holes/excursions/ways-of-working.json (claude-2 with Joe, 2026-11-02)
@why [creativity-commons/place-boundaries creativity-commons/nested-places]

! conclusion: Every hyperedge section reads OK and the five standards (regenerates, evidence, reconstitution, honest holes, composed) hold.

  + IF:
    Knowing what exists and its state, with provenance, at stack scale.

  + HOWEVER:
    Each subsystem keeps its own records and its own view. Each view looks complete from inside, so a gap between them is invisible.

  + THEN:
    Every hyperedge section reads OK and the five standards (regenerates, evidence, reconstitution, honest holes, composed) hold.

  + BECAUSE:
    State that has no provenance cannot be acted on at stack scale. A hole that is named can be filled, and one that is unnamed is taken for coverage.

  + VALIDATION:
    Do the hyperedge sections read OK, and do the five standards hold?
